# incarnamind
===
 From messy files to a checked report. A free, open-source desktop app for macOS, Windows and Linux: write and analyse with AI from your own files, check each sentence and figure against them, and export to Word. Meeting notes too. Works with ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini or a local model through Ollama.
